          <h2>Built on Electrical Safety, Speed &amp; Honest Pricing</h2>
          <p>{{ site.BRAND }} was created to solve a common homeowner frustration: finding a qualified electrician quickly when a circuit breaker trips, buzzes, smells hot, or shuts off essential power.</p>
          <p>We connect customers with vetted local electrical contractors whose trucks carry common single-pole, double-pole, AFCI, GFCI, and 100A–200A main breakers along with thermal imaging cameras and digital clamp meters for accurate first-visit repairs.</p>
